SUMMARY:FAC's Sky Stage Presents: Libby Knight with Special Guests
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to the release of FAC's new record label Good People! Join us at Sky Stage on Friday\, October 30\, for an evening of live music featuring Libby Knight and other speicial guests with Retro/Ricole serving as MC! Enjoy an intimate live performance from Libby Knight in the unique atmosphere of Sky Stage\, Frederick’s historic outdoor performing arts venue. Retro/Ricole will guide the evening as MC\, bringing energy and personality to this special night of music and community. Enjoy other special guest performances throughout the evening as well.
