SUMMARY:Brewer's Alley Halloween Party
DESCRIPTION:Spend Halloween in the heart of historic Downtown Frederick at Brewer’s Alley! Join us Saturday\, October 31\, from 10 PM–1 AM for spooky specials\, music from Benefactor DJs\, and costume prizes worth dressing up for! Main Bar\, Terrace Bar & Rooftop Bar open! COSTUME PRIZES 1st: $150 gift card + hoodie 2nd: $100 gift card + tee 3rd: $50 gift card + bottle opener Bring your crew and your best costume for the ultimate downtown Frederick Halloween experience!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/brewers-alley-halloween-party/22475/
